Package: gromtools
Type: Package
Title: Computation Tools for Genetically Regulated Omics with PGEN Streaming
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Marios", "Anyfantakis", email = "anyfantakis.marios@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides high-throughput imputation of genetically regulated omics 
    from genotype data using additive linear models that assume only linear SNP effects, 
    optimized for large-scale applications.
